dialogs
0	Wow! It's huge!The BATTLE TOWER feels special. It's different from the others.
1	My grand ambition is to conquer both the BATTLE FRONTIER and the POKéMON LEAGUE.And if my dream comes true…I… I'm going to ask MIMI next door if she will be friends with me!
2	The BATTLE PYRAMID's too harsh! I just can't make it to the top!Since I'm out of options, maybe I can climb the outside…
3	I thrive in darkness… Yes… What is worthy of me? None other than the BATTLE PYRAMID…What say you to wandering in darkness and in utter and total desperation?
4	I didn't sleep for a week, but then I put together the ultimate team!I can't see myself losing, no joke. We're storming the BATTLE ARENA!
5	ZIGG! I believe in you, little buddy!I'll make my little ZIGG any favorite tasty treats you like if you win!
6	I may not look that impressive now, but I once beat a GYM LEADER.Who knows, maybe I should give it another shot at glory.
7	Did SCOTT bring you here, too? What is it with that guy?It sounds like he really does know how to spot talented TRAINERS, but…I've never seen him battling in person ever.
8	People call me a busybody, but I can't help it.Your hat's on crooked! Oh, no, trash on the ground! Oops, it's almost dinnertime!I don't know if I can stand to just watch at the BATTLE PALACE…
9	I'm fast on my BIKE, and that goes for the way I battle, too.I win matches in the blink of an eye!
10	I'm better than my daddy at POKéMON.
11	Go on, my baby sweetie! Go rack up some wins for Daddy!You're just like your mother, so you'll be dominating!
12	ZIGZAGOON looks vacant…
14	It wasn't easy getting here, but I'd heard about this knockout pretty girl at the BATTLE ARENA.Instead of her, do you know what I found?A whole teeming mob of sweaty, stinky, and primitive martial artists!
15	I sometimes see this really important- looking old man going in there.He has these really awesome POKéMON. He seems really nice, though.
16	Do you know it? The legend of the BATTLE PYRAMID?When there comes a confident TRAINER reaching for the golden pinnacle, there shall appear a man among men.Don't know that legend? Well, of course not! I just made it up!What's it supposed to mean? That, my friend, I can't say!
17	Man! Oh man! I've never lost once before!But I got wiped out with no saving grace at all!And then I'm told I don't have any talent?! Man!
18	This guy ran into a horribly tough TRAINER while he was on the BATTLE TOWER challenge.Now look at him…You need to be cautious if you ever decide to go to the BATTLE TOWER.
19	Yes! I've finally got enough Battle Points!I guess I'll trade for another giant plush DOLL!
20	Oh, yeah, okay! So this is the RANKING HALL!I'd like to go down in history as a super champ and have my name recorded here for posterity.
21	With you by my side, I can do anything.
22	Ooh, darling, you are so wonderful!Ooh, I just can't wait anymore!Let's go to a MULTI BATTLE ROOM right this instant!If we get together in the BATTLE SALON, the power of our love will overcome everyone we meet.Why, before us, darling, everything will topple like dominoes!
23	Excuse me, young one. Have you good eyesight?There is an odd tree past here, and to my tired eyes it seems to wiggle.
24	The BATTLE FRONTIER isn't exclusively for tough TRAINERS.Many people with special abilities have been invited, it seems.That man SCOTT…He may have built this place to serve a bigger objective…
25	I… I saw it!There was a sticky sort of a POKéMON with a long tail up ahead!It was hiding under a boulder, and it kept staring at me!
